---
const title = 'Página no encontrada | CVG';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="anonymous" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="CVG and Co., inicio">
        <img src="/images/cvg-logo.webp" alt="CVG &amp; Co." width="399" height="245" />
      </a>
      <p class="eyebrow">ERROR 404</p>
      <h1>Esta página no está disponible.</h1>
      <p class="description">Puede que la dirección haya cambiado. Vuelve al inicio y encuentra el camino.</p>
      <a class="button" href="/">Volver al inicio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(body) {
    display: grid;
    min-height: 100vh;
    place-items: center;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 24px;
    background: #f5f5f3;
    color: #111111;
    font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
  }
  main { width: min(100%, 600px); }
  .wordmark { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 96px; color: #111111; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -1.5px; text-decoration: none; }
  .wordmark img { display: block; width: 112px; height: 69px; object-fit: contain; }
  .eyebrow { color: #656563; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.4px; line-height: 16px; }
  h1 { margin-block: 16px; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -2.2px; line-height: 1; text-wrap: balance; }
  .description { max-width: 480px; margin-bottom: 24px; color: #6e6e6c; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; min-height: 48px; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; background: #111111; color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 24px; text-decoration: none; transition: transform 700ms cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1); }
  .button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .button:active { transform: translateY(1px) scale(0.98); }
  .button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #555555; outline-offset: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) { h1 { font-size: 36px; letter-spacing: -1.5px; } .wordmark { margin-bottom: 64px; } }
</style>
